# YAML config (IoriCTW)

## settings.yml
- `SETTINGS`, `PLAYTIME`, `COOLDOWNS`, `NOTIFICATIONS`, `FRIENDS`, `COMMAND-WHITELIST`, `ANNOUNCEMENTS` (intervalo/random/sound), `ANALYTICS`, `MODULES`
- Comentarios `# ~` solo explican para qué sirve

## Archivos por dominio
`redis.yml`, `database.yml`, `motd.yml`, `fallback.yml`, `queue.yml`, `commands.yml`, `permissions.yml`, `maintenance.yml`, `donations.yml`

## Anuncios
Lista ordenada en `messages/{lang}.yml` → `ANNOUNCEMENTS:` (bloques `|`). Sin keys. Random/intervalo en settings.

## Eliminados (settings / messages)
`report.yml`, `helpop.yml`, `friends.yml`, `stream.yml`, `command-whitelist.yml`, `blacklist.yml`, `playtime.yml`, `announcements.yml`, `analytics.yml`

## Estilo
Separadores `# ***` / `# ──`, claves UPPERCASE kebab.
Webhooks: `webhooks/*.yml` estilo Helium (TITLE + DESCRIPTION).

## Comentarios (obligatorio al crear YAML)
Ver `.cursor/design/yaml-comments.md`:
- Placeholders: bloque `#  Placeholder's ↓` + `#   · {KEY}` o `# ~ Placeholders: ...`
- Separadores sección / comando / messages

## Discord avatars
Default bust: `https://visage.surgeplay.com/bust/152/%player%`
(Alt helm: minotar — ver `.cursor/design/discord-avatars.md`)
